    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST SECOND-LOOP\u2122!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/7808299fe5031c7340c36789cbc4b8d9.poster.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/7808299fe5031c7340c36789cbc4b8d9.webm?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/7808299fe5031c7340c36789cbc4b8d9.mp4?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/f4185bae093da685afff573a16b8805e.poster.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/f4185bae093da685afff573a16b8805e.webm?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/f4185bae093da685afff573a16b8805e.mp4?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/ea63531de3000bbf64703f88ca88bccd.webp?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=62 /></span><br><strong>SECOND-LOOP\u2122</strong> is a FPS action game with sandbox physics puzzle solving, \u2014 you're the robot pilot in the heart of a futuristic dystopian world. Control your Goliath in intense combat, and use your ability to manipulate gravity + assemble mechanical parts to solve physics puzzles.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/2b04d04938a5624468e90b8d7584aa71.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/a4b3568aa237711db8ac479ce07f3f32.poster.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/a4b3568aa237711db8ac479ce07f3f32.webm?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>PHYSICS : Sandbox Physics Puzzle Solving</strong></h2>In the rain world where hope hangs by a thread, SECOND-LOOP\u2122 bestows upon you, a hero mech pilot, an extraordinary gift: the power to bend the very fabric of reality. With gravity-defying abilities, manipulate objects - catch, lift, and reshape debris and components telekinetically.<br><br><strong>But raw force is just the start.</strong> Use your abilities to disassemble and reassemble your surroundings into new constructions to overcome any obstacle. Unbounded by linear thinking, your imagination is the key.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/f649f1eb9d132bbd12845e8163081cf3.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/1cbf63e798f0dd183fab772deec864c6.poster.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/1cbf63e798f0dd183fab772deec864c6.webm?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>CREATION : Imagine It, Build It, Drive It.</strong></h2>From eccentric sports cars with tank treads to aircraft \u2014 if you can dream it, build it in SECOND-LOOP\u2122. Craft any vehicle using machine parts, then take your outrageous creation for an unbridled test drive - soaring through the skies, racing down roads, or sailing across waves!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/dc97fa4a8eafd11680fda341d91b512b.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/4f4314805d2e9994bb95cae6575ce3a7.poster.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/4f4314805d2e9994bb95cae6575ce3a7.webm?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>VISUALS : Watch The Patter of Rain on Shattered Concrete</strong></h2>Immerse yourself in a hauntingly beautiful post-apocalyptic cityscape, where the remnants of a once-thriving metropolis, now drenched in an endless downpour, have long since blurred the boundaries between technology and nature.<br><i>Unreal Engine 5. Semi-body-cam. But no cops or ghosts.</i><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/b9a23956c9a1e61020100296265f9a7c.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/83d0f29467efcc849df2509d5296eebd.poster.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/83d0f29467efcc849df2509d5296eebd.webm?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>STORY : Be the Spark That Ignites the Revolution</strong></h2>In SECOND-LOOP\u2122, you are not just a hero, but a symbol of resistance against the oppressive forces that seek to control the world. Your actions will inspire others to join the fight, leading to a climactic confrontation that will determine the future of humanity.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/cb09a4adb6773a97380cdc6cac0637bb.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/f5f50029aff6ffa0e998b06b54766bb6.poster.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/f5f50029aff6ffa0e998b06b54766bb6.webm?t=1743232819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022\u00a0<strong>COMBAT : Adrenaline-Fueled Against Brilliant AI Enemies</strong></h2>Engage in heart-pounding combat that puts you at the center of the action, facing off against advanced AI opponents that adapt to your playstyle and employ cunning strategies. Feel the rush of adrenaline as you dodge incoming fire, unleash devastating combo attacks.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830070/extras/7c6903f45d3370c7ad57aee8ed7ca344.avif?t=1743232819\" width=616 height=72 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst